ne endpoint, every model</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Chat, embeddings, vision, audio and images behind a single OpenAI-compatible surface. Swap your base URL and ship.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-[var(--color-border-bright)] h-full" style="transform:perspective(900px)"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(340px circle at 50% 50%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cyan) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-violet) 16%, transparent);color:var(--color-violet)"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="8" ry="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></ellipse><path d="M4 6v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V6M4 12v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Pay per call in USDC</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Settle each request on Base with the x402 protocol. No accounts, no API keys, no monthly minimums.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-[var(--color-border-bright)] h-full" style="transform:perspective(900px)"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" style=