ime)">&quot;Explain x402 in one line.&quot;</span><span>}</span></span></div><div class="table-row"><span class="table-cell select-none pr-5 text-right text-[var(--color-fg-dim)] opacity-50">8</span><span class="table-cell whitespace-pre"><span>    </span><span>]</span></span></div><div class="table-row"><span class="table-cell select-none pr-5 text-right text-[var(--color-fg-dim)] opacity-50">9</span><span class="table-cell whitespace-pre"><span>  </span><span>}</span><span style="color:var(--color-lime)">&#x27;</span></span></div></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 sm:py-28"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-gradient p-10 sm:p-14"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden opacity-60"><div class="absolute -left-32 -top-24 h-[34rem] w-[34rem] rounded-full opacity-30 blur-[110px]" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-cyan), transparent 62%);animation:var(--animate-blob)"></div><div class="absolute right-[-10rem] top-10 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full opacity-25 blur-[120px]" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-violet), transparent 62%);animation:var(--animate-blob-slow)"></div><div class="absolute bottom-[-12rem] left-1/3 h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full opacity-20 blur-[120px]" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-magenta), transparent 62%);animation:var(--animate-blob);animation-delay:-8s"></div></div><div class="relative"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><p class="text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-cyan)]">Performance</p><h2 class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-center font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Built for speed and reliability</h2></div><div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"><span class="text-gradient"><span>0.00<!-- -->%</span></span></div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Gateway uptime</div></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"><span class="text-gradient"><span>0<!-- -->ms</span></span></div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Median first token</div></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"><span class="text-gradient"><span>0<!-- -->+</span></span></div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Models available</div></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"><span class="text-gradient"><span>0<!-- -->%</span></span></div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Flat margin at settlement</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="pricing" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6"><div class="mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><span class="inline-block rounded-full glass px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-cyan)]">Pricing</span></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><h2 class="mt-5 font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Pay only for <span class="text-gradient">what you use</span></h2></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">No subscriptions. No minimums. Provider cost plus a flat 5% margin — or pay per call in USDC with x402.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="relative flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-7 transition-colors glass hover:border-[var(--color-border-bright)]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Pay as you go</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">For builders shipping fast.</p><div class="mt-5 font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Usage</div><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-cyan)_20%,transparent)] text-[var(--color-cyan)]"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>OpenAI-compatible endpoint</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-cyan)_20%,transparent)] text-[var(--color-cyan)]"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>All chat &amp; embedding models</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-cyan)_20%,transparent)] text-[var(--color-cyan)]"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>Provider cost + 5% fla