ontact sales</a></div></div></div></section><section id="security" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-center"><div><div class="mb-14 max-w-2xl "><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><span class="inline-block rounded-full glass px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-cyan)]">Security &amp; privacy</span></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><h2 class="mt-5 font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Trust is the <span class="text-gradient">default</span></h2></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Enterprise-grade controls from day one — so autonomous agents and finance teams can rely on every call.</p></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl glass p-4"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-live)_18%,transparent)] text-[var(--color-live)]"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 10-4.5-2-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><div><div class="text-sm font-semibold">We don&#x27;t share your data</div><div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-fg-dim)]">Read our privacy policy →</div></div></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-[var(--color-border-bright)] h-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(340px circle at 50% 50%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cyan) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] text-[var(--color-cyan)]"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></rect><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Encrypted in transit</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">All traffic is TLS-encrypted end to end. Secrets live only in your environment, never in the repo.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-[var(--color-border-bright)] h-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(340px circle at 50% 50%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cyan) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] text-[var(--color-cyan)]"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></circle><path d="M11 12l7-7 3 3M15 8l2 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">HMAC-authenticated keys</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">API keys are HMAC-SHA256 verified with per-org RBAC and granular scopes.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-[var(--color-border-bright)] h-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(340px circle at 50% 50%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cyan) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] text-[var(--color-cyan)]"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7-10-7-10-7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></circle></svg></span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">We don&#x27;t train on your data</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Prompts are proxied to upstream providers and never used for training or sold.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-[var(--color-border-bright)] h-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(340px circle at 50% 50%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cyan) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] text-[var(--color-cyan)]"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2h12v20l-3-2-3 2-3-2-3 2V2z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 7h6M9 11h6M9 15h4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">On-chain audit trail</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Every x402 settlement is verifiable on Base, with correlation-ID tracing on every request.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6"><div class="mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><span class="inline-block rounded-full glass px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-cyan)]">Loved by builders</span></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><h2 class="mt-5 font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Teams shipping on <span class="text-gradient">CortexCloud</span></h2></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="mb-14 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 opacity-60 sm:grid-cols-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Northwind</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Helix</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Aperture</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Quantise</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Meridian</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">Vectorly</span></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><figure class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl glass p-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4 flex gap-0.5 text-[var(--color-amber)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg></div><blockquote class="flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg)]">“<!-- -->We swapped our base URL and had agents paying per call in an afternoon. The x402 flow just works.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-5 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-4"><div class="text-sm font-semibold">A. Rivera</div><div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-fg-dim)]">Founder, autonomous trading startup</div></figcaption></figure><figure class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl glass p-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4 flex gap-0.5 text-[var(--color-amber)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg></div><blockquote class="flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg)]">“<!-- -->One endpoint for every model plus on-chain receipts killed three internal tools overnight.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-5 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-4"><div class="text-sm font-semibold">J. Osei</div><div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-fg-dim)]">Staff engineer, AI infra</div></figcaption></figure><figure class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl glass p-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4 flex gap-0.5 text-[var(--color-amber)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.6.6-5.8 5 1.8 7.4L12 18l-6.4 3.9 1.8-7.4-5.8-5 7.6-.6z"></path></svg></div><blockquote class="flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg)]">“<!-- -->The flat 5% margin and no lock-in made the finance conversation trivial. Shipped to prod in a week.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-5 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-4"><div class="text-sm font-semibold">M. Lindqvist</div><div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-fg-dim)]">CTO, agent platform</div></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6"><div class="mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><span class="inline-block rounded-full glass px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-cyan)]">FAQ</span></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><h2 class="mt-5 font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Questions, <span class="text-gradient">answered</span></h2></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass"><button aria-expanded="true" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-base font-semibold">What is x402 and why does it matter?</span><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-cyan)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></button><div style="height:auto;opacity:1"><p class="px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">x402 revives the HTTP 402 &#x27;Payment Required&#x27; status as a real payment handshake. An agent hits an endpoint, receives a signed price, settles USDC on Base, and retries — all in milliseconds. No accounts, no cards, no keys.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-base font-semibold">Is CortexCloud really OpenAI-compatible?</span><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-cyan)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-base font-semibold">How do agents pay without an API key?</span><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-cyan)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-base font-semibold">Which chains and currencies are supported?</span><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-cyan)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-base font-semibold">What does it cost?</span><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-cyan)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-base font-semibold">How is my data handled?</span><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-cyan)]" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border-gradient px-8 py-16 text-center sm:px-16 sm:py-24"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 grid-bg "></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden "><div class="absolute -left-32 -top-24 h-[34rem] w-[34rem] rounded-full opacity-30 blur-[110px]" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-cyan), transparent 62%);animation:var(--animate-blob)"></div><div class="absolute right-[-10rem] top-10 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full opacity-25 blur-[120px]" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-violet), transparent 62%);animation:var(--animate-blob-slow)"></div><div class="absolute bottom-[-12rem] left-1/3 h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full opacity-20 blur-[120px]" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-magenta), transparent 62%);animation:var(--animate-blob);animation-delay:-8s"></div></div><div class="relative"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><h2 class="mx-auto max-w-2xl font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">Ship your agent on <span class="text-gradient-anim">CortexCloud</span></h2></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-[var(--color-fg-muted)]">One endpoint. Every model. Pay per call in USDC. Start free — no card, no signup.</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)"><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3"><a href="#pricing" class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide transition-colors duration-300 will-change-transform focus-visible:outline-2 text-black bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-cyan)] to-[var(--color-teal)] hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_-8px_var(--color-cyan)] " style="transform:none">Start building<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><a href="https://api.cortexcloud.org/docs" class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide transition-colors duration-300 will-change-transform focus-visible:outline-2 text-[var(--color-fg)] glass hover:border-[var(--color-cyan)] " style="transform:none">Read the docs</a></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-16 pb-10"><div aria-hidden="tr